              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Simone Maduro"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great bace recipe.. I have many allergies so I always have to substitute.. \nI omitted the yogurt and the sugar (major allergies to me) \n\nI added rice milk and coconut nectar \n\nAlso did not have anise which I think would add a yummy flavor and I also added water \n\nOH wow came out",
            "datePublished": "2016-03-16T15:29:17.857Z"
          },
